{%- comment -%}
  JATAYU Luxury Fashion — FAQ Accordion Section
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="faq-section" style="padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 120px) 0; margin-top: var(--header-height);">
  <div class="page-width">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <span class="label-eyebrow">COMMON QUERIES</span>
        <h1 class="heading-section" style="color: var(--color-maroon-primary); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h1>
        <p style="color: rgba(33, 27, 25, 0.8);">
          Everything you need to know about our collections, fit, delivery, and care.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pdp-accordions" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);">
        <div class="accordion-item is-open">
          <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="true">
            <span>What materials and fabric weights do you use?</span>
            {% render 'icon-chevron' %}
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content">
            <p>Our oversized and classic T-shirts are crafted from premium 220–240 GSM combed organic cotton. Our hoodies are constructed from heavyweight 380–400 GSM brushed fleece cotton, providing an architectural drape, warmth, and lifelong durability.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item">
          <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>How do the garments fit?</span>
            {% render 'icon-chevron' %}
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content">
            <p>Our T-shirts feature an intentional oversized cut with dropped shoulders and a boxy silhouette. If you prefer a relaxed standard look, take your usual size. For a more fitted appearance, consider sizing down one size. Please refer to our Size Guide for detailed measurements.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item">
          <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>What are your domestic shipping timelines?</span>
            {% render 'icon-chevron' %}
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content">
            <p>Orders are dispatched within 24 to 48 hours. Standard courier transit across metro cities typically takes 3 to 5 business days, while non-metro regions may take up to 6 business days.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item">
          <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>What is your return and exchange policy?</span>
            {% render 'icon-chevron' %}
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content">
            <p>We provide a 7-day exchange window for sizing adjustments on unworn, unwashed items in original packaging with intact tags. Please initiate exchange requests through our contact portal.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item">
          <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>How should I wash and care for my JATAYU pieces?</span>
            {% render 'icon-chevron' %}
          </button>
          <div class="accordion-content">
            <p>We recommend machine washing cold on a gentle cycle inside out with similar colors. Avoid bleach and tumble drying; line dry in shade to preserve fabric softness and artwork vibrancy. Iron inside out on low heat.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
